## 🎯 YOUR ACTION PLAN

Here's exactly what you need to do to get your app working:

### STEP 1: Copy All The Code (10 minutes)

- `src/config/products.ts` - Payment configuration
- `src/app/api/webhook/stripe/route.ts` - Stripe webhook
- `src/app/api/webhook/gumroad/route.ts` - Gumroad webhook
